<title>USA: Crown Casino to buy CH Medical for $40 mln.</title>
<headline>Crown Casino to buy CH Medical for $40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Casino Corp said on Monday that its wholly owned subsidiary, Cardio Acquisition Corp, has into a definitive agreement to buy all the assets and operations of CH Medical Inc.</p>
<p>Under the deal, the company would acquire CH Medical for $40 million in cash, a $5 million subordinated note and the assumption of certain liabilities.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
